# Tribunal "The Black Dart Gang": Narisa Adus in the Bazaar Sewers tells how
# the gang killed her lover ("I'm sorry. Can I help?" is choice 1; the entry,
# 1, 5 or 10, follows the player's level). The four gang members wait in the
# Temple Sewers West; once all four are dead, Narisa gives Variner's Ring
# (100). Kills stand in for the fights; `defend` takes the darts. Ref FormIDs
# carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ms_summoner --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ms_black_dart
run
player->PositionCell -2681 4317 -163 0 "Old Mournhold: Bazaar Sewers"
until 600 "Narisa Adus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Narisa Adus
ask Black Dart Gang
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex MS_BlackDart >= 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell -5400 0 -800 0 "Old Mournhold: Temple Sewers West"
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Temple Sewers West" == 1
defend
wait 150
console 06927036.kill
console 06B2AD3F.kill
console 06B8EC6F.kill
console 066E5B43.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "Black Dart Urvyn" == 1
run
player->PositionCell -2681 4317 -163 0 "Old Mournhold: Bazaar Sewers"
until 600 "Narisa Adus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Narisa Adus
ask Black Dart Gang
expect GetJournalIndex MS_BlackDart == 100
expect player->GetItemCount "Variner's Ring" == 1
bye
end
